<title>USA: Viking names Helford Chairman/CEO till 2002.</title>
<headline>Viking names Helford Chairman/CEO till 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viking Office Products Inc said Tuesday it had entered into a new five-year agreement with Irwin Helford to continue to serve as chairman and chief executive until June 2002.</p>
<p>Tee company also said it would release its fourth quarter and fiscal year earnings on August 20.</p>
</text>
